Some sample kernels for "convolve":

avg	3x3 8-neighbor uniform average

grad	3x3 4-neighbor diagonal gradient

lap	3x3 4-neighbor Laplacian

marr	11x11 circular Marr (Laplacian-of-Gaussian)

sharp	3x3 4-neighbor sharpening (Laplacian+original)

vert	3x3 6-neighbor vertical edge (Sobel)

